# Melee counts the opponents its controller attacked this combat, not planeswalkers (CR 702.121a, the rulings): Wulfgar of
# Icewind Dale attacks Bot2's Liliana of the Veil alone. Melee still triggers - twice, by Wulfgar's own rule - but each
# gives +0/+0, so a 4/4 deals 4 to Liliana (loyalty 3), who dies, and Bot2 takes nothing.
# Turn 1: Wulfgar (Mountain, Black Lotus GGG, Mox Emerald). Turn 2: Liliana (a Swamp and Black Lotus BBB). Turn 3: the
# attack. (wulfgar-melee-triggers-twice-for-one-opponent is the attack on the player.)

